 iversity! He will be presenting "Battery-free Wireless Bioelectronic Netwo
 rk for Effective Chronic Disease Management." Abstract: 60% of the US popu
 lation live with at least one chronic disease. These diseases and associat
 ed comorbidities are now the leading causes of death. Effective management
  of complex chronic diseases requires body-wide\, long-term\, accurate\, a
 nd continuous monitoring of multiple physiological signals from wearable d
 evices to precisely determine the pathological state. These wearable physi
 ological signal monitoring can dramatically reduce\nCategory: Lectures & S
