DESCRIPTION:The Middle East Policy Forum\, in partnership with the Institu
 te for Security and Conflict Studies \, welcomes Professor Sina Azodi \, A
 mbassador (ret.) Bonnie Jenkins \, and subject area expert Ms. Clara Sherw
 ood\, to discuss Nuclear Risks and Regional Stability in the Middle East. 
 The Middle East nuclear debate has never been more relevant than it is in 
 2026. To discuss this issue\, our panelists will examine regional and glob
 al attitudes towards nuclear weapons in the Middle East\, with an eye towa
 rd generating conclusions and strategies regarding the future of non-proli
 feration in the region. This distinguished panel includes Professor Sina A
 zodi\, a renowned Iran expert whose recent book\, Iran \nCategory: Academi
